id: performance-enhancer
name: Performance Enhancer
kind: gear
tags: med
craftDC: Master
# "Spend an Action to consume this Basic Item."
placeCost: 1
# Its Details. Consumable: "destroyed once it is used".
details: medicine, consumable
# What consuming it does, said on the card: there are no Transformations here yet, so entering the
# Enhancement is the table's.
# No comma in it: a header splits on commas.
consumeNote: enters the Doping Enhancement (even without access to it)
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Consume it for an Action: you enter the Doping Enhancement, even without access to it.
text: >
  Performance Enhancer [Med]: A powerful medication that improves your athletic prowess.
  –Craft DC: Master
  –Details: Medicine, Consumable
  –Effects: Spend an Action to consume this Basic Item and enter the Doping Enhancement (even if
  you do not have access to it).

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Consume: 1 Action, the card says they enter the Doping Enhancement, and it is used up.
#
# --- What is not built -------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Doping Enhancement itself: Transformations are not in this system yet. Entering it is the
# table's until they are.
